Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"q1": "<h3 id=\"例1-丙子日-土将助财-六亲-天将\">【例1】丙子日 · 土将助财 <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：土将助财格 · 丙子日第九局（夜占·酉加巳），三传酉丑巳合金局皆财、夜将皆土神生财</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙子日</strong>夜里来占求财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　子孙　太常</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　兄弟　勾陈</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丙</strong>，夜占。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财取<strong>妻财</strong>，&quot;我克者妻财&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙是<strong>火</strong>、火克<strong>金</strong>，金是财。三传 <strong>巳酉丑三合金局</strong>(巳酉丑合金)，整条三传作财。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　看天将——一排土将都在生财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：天将会生克脚下的字。<strong>土能生金</strong>，土的天将(贵人/太常/勾陈，五行属土)乘在财上，就等于给财添力。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘夜占，三传的财上所乘天将都是<strong>土神</strong>——土生金，<strong>一排天将齐齐生财</strong>，财势格外旺。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　这财能不能大取</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：财旺、又被天将成排生助，取财顺遂；但同一张盘，换个占问事，结论未必相同。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原文&quot;大宜求财、尤宜成合事&quot;。但要留意：这盘<strong>不利父母、占病则凶</strong>(火泄于金、金反被土生而旺克丙)——<strong>同一盘，占财大吉、占病却不吉</strong>，别拿一盘通断百事。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：大宜求财、尤宜成合事（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 巳酉丑三合金局作财　② 土将(贵人/太常/勾陈)土生金＝成排助财　③ 财得众将生助则势旺　④ 同一盘占财吉、占病凶——别一盘通断百事</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·土将助财格</p>\n<hr>", "q2": "<h3 id=\"例2-戊申日-财多反而担不起-六亲-旺衰\">【例2】戊申日 · 财多反而担不起 <code>六亲</code> <code>旺衰</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：三传财太过格 · 戊申日第五局，三传申子辰水局财太旺</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>戊申日</strong>来占求财。盘里不是没财，恰恰是财太多、太旺；这次要学会为什么&quot;财多&quot;也可能不得财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　妻财　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　子孙　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　兄弟　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>是 <strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong>，合看为<strong>申子辰水局</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>是 <strong>戊土</strong>，干上为 <strong>丑</strong>、支上为 <strong>辰</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先认财——三传合成水局</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财仍取<strong>妻财</strong>，口诀是&quot;我克者妻财&quot;。三传凑齐三合局时，要先看<strong>整体合成的五行</strong>，不能把三个字拆开各说各的。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：戊属<strong>土</strong>，土克<strong>水</strong>，所以戊日以水为财。三传虽然按次序是子、申、辰，但三字齐全正是<strong>申子辰三合水局</strong>，整条三传都化作财。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　财并非越多越好——还要看我扛不扛得住</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：财是&quot;我去克、去掌控&quot;的东西，也会消耗我的力量。好比眼前货物再多，自己没有本钱、仓库和人手，也搬不走。六壬因此不只问<strong>有没有财</strong>，还要比较<strong>日干与财谁强谁弱</strong>：身能任财才拿得住，财太旺而身弱便叫&quot;财太过&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘三传合成一整片旺水，财势集中；若又在<strong>秋冬水旺</strong>的时令，水更旺、戊土更难制服。原著说此时水&quot;自贪其生旺，不能与我作财&quot;，不是看不见钱，而是<strong>财太旺、我担不起</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　什么时候才适合取</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：同一课的吉凶会随旺衰改变。身弱财旺时不宜硬取；等自身得令、或财气稍退，力量平衡后才有承财的条件。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以秋冬水旺时若强行取财，反要防<strong>倒贴本钱、耗费己财</strong>；等到戊土较旺、或水财稍衰的月令，才可再取。原文也补了一层：若日干本来强旺，仍可按有财断，不能见&quot;三传皆财&quot;就一律说凶。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：不宜取财；强取反费己财，待身旺或财稍衰时再取</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 戊土以水为财　② 申子辰整体合水局　③ 财多不等于一定得财，还要身能任财　④ 身弱财旺宜等自身转旺或财气稍衰</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·三传财太过格</p>\n<hr>", "q3": "<h3 id=\"例3-丙子日-空财也有特定用法-旬空-六亲-天将-类神\">【例3】丙子日 · 空财也有特定用法 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：空财格 · 丙子日第九局（夜占），酉加巳、酉财空亡、夜将反生三传财（宜索债）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙子日</strong>夜里占财。这个盘与上一例&quot;土将助财&quot;是同一张盘，却从<strong>初传空亡</strong>切入，专看普通求财和索取旧债为何要分开断。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　子孙　太常</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　兄弟　勾陈</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>是 <strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>为 <strong>丙火</strong>，干上和发用都是 <strong>酉</strong>。丙子属甲戌旬，旬空 <strong>申、酉</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　财就在发用，但先查空亡</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财先找妻财，再查财是否空亡。<strong>发用</strong>是事情最先发动的地方；用神发用本来醒目，但若同时旬空，就像事情开了头却没有实物承接。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙属<strong>火</strong>，火克<strong>金</strong>，所以金是丙日之财。初传酉属金，既是财、又是发用；但丙子日属<strong>甲戌旬，空申酉</strong>，所以这枚酉财正好旬空。它还同时是<strong>干上</strong>，等于财贴身发动却先成空壳。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　再看天将有没有补力</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：空亡会削弱用神，但还要继续看天将的生克。天将的五行若生财，表示外在条件仍在给财添力，不能只见一个&quot;空&quot;字就把后续信息全部抹掉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：此课夜占，三传上所乘的<strong>贵人（土）、太常（土）、勾陈（土）</strong>都是土将；土生金，所以三传合成的金财仍得土将生助。格局因此出现两层：<strong>酉财本身旬空</strong>，但<strong>天将又在生财</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为什么普通求财不如索债</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：新财要从无到有，最怕财空；旧债却是过去已经形成的财，只是现在尚未收回。若盘中仍有生财之力，空财有时可理解为把悬空未落实的旧账催回来。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：因此普通求一笔新财，仍要防<strong>看得见、落不了袋</strong>；若问的是索取旧债，原著反说夜将生财，<strong>亦宜索债</strong>。同一格不能脱离具体占问：求新财与追旧账，结论并不相同。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：普通求新财防落空；若为追索旧债，反可催取（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 丙火以金为财　② 丙子属甲戌旬、酉财旬空　③ 贵人土、太常土、勾陈土皆能生金财　④ 新财怕空，旧债有生助时仍可索取</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·空财格</p>\n<hr>", "q4": "<h3 id=\"例4-甲子日-暗中有人助财-旬空-六亲-类神\">【例4】甲子日 · 暗中有人助财 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：末助初财格 · 甲子日第三局，末传午生初传戌土、戌土作甲干之财，反克干上神子水（暗中财助·初传戌空）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲子日</strong>来占求财。盘里有人在后面给财添力，但这笔财本身既空，又会伤到干上的父母爻，是一则&quot;有助力也不能只报喜&quot;的例子。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　玄武　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　子孙　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>是 <strong>甲木</strong>，干上 <strong>子</strong>、支上与发用都是 <strong>戌</strong>。甲子旬空戌亥，所以初传戌空。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找财，并分清干上和发用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：甲木克土，所以甲日以土为财。位置名称要分清：<strong>干上</strong>是第一课上神，<strong>支上</strong>是日支上神，<strong>发用</strong>才是初传；三者可能相同，也可能不同。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘干上是<strong>子水</strong>，不是戌；支上与发用才是<strong>戌土</strong>。戌土被甲木所克，所以初传戌是财，事情一发动便落在财上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　看末传怎样回头帮助初传</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传不只按初、中、末顺着读，也会看后传是否回头生助前传。若<strong>末传生初传</strong>，像有人从幕后给事情的开端补上力量；初传若是财，便叫&quot;末助初财&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：末传<strong>午属火</strong>，初传<strong>戌属土</strong>，火生土，所以午火回头生旺戌土之财。原著据此说，<strong>暗中有人以财相助</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　助财不等于毫无代价</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：得到一条吉象后，还要检查用神空不空、它又去生克谁。吉象若带空，落实程度会打折；财若克父母爻，也可能以文书、长辈、房产或本钱受损为代价。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：甲子旬空戌亥，所以被午火生助的<strong>初传戌财仍是空财</strong>，帮助未必马上落实；同时戌土克干上子水，子水生甲木、属<strong>父母</strong>，于是财反伤干上父母爻。可断有人暗助或有财机，但要防<strong>口惠未实、为财损本或伤文书长辈之事</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：暗中有人以财相助，但助力落实较慢，并防为财损本</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 干上子、支上与发用戌，位置不可混　② 午火生戌土＝末助初财　③ 初传财空则落实打折　④ 财克父母爻，要防得财同时损本</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·末助初财格</p>\n<hr>", "q5": "<h3 id=\"例5-辛酉日-两处有财却不宜借-旬空\">【例5】辛酉日 · 两处有财却不宜借 <code>旬空</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：借钱还债格 · 辛酉日第八局，干上卯、支上寅俱为日财（不宜求财）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛酉日</strong>来问借贷求财。干上、支上各坐一枚财，看起来两边都有钱可来，原著却提醒这类钱往往来路去路纠缠不清。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">己　父母　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">子孙　天空　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　官鬼　天后</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>是 <strong>未 → 子 → 巳</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>为 <strong>辛金</strong>，干上 <strong>卯</strong>、支上 <strong>寅</strong>，两者都是木财。辛酉属甲寅旬，旬空子丑，中传子空。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　两处财分别在哪里</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：辛属金，金克木，所以辛日以木为财。读盘时不要只盯三传，干上代表贴近自身的一面，支上代表对方、环境或所占事情的落脚处。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘干上是<strong>卯木</strong>，支上是<strong>寅木</strong>，两者都是辛金之财。财同时临干支，看上去像自己这边和外部那边都有财路。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　为什么有两财还说不宜求</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占财不能只数财的个数，还要问这钱<strong>以什么方式来、来了要往哪里去</strong>。借来的钱虽然一时到手，却同时形成债务；如果只是拆东墙补西墙，财来并不等于真正增加。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原著把干支上都见财的这种纠缠称为&quot;<strong>借钱还债</strong>&quot;：一边的财刚来，另一边已有去处，账目往来不明。问普通求财，尤其问借贷周转，不宜把&quot;眼前有钱&quot;误断成净得。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　中传空，过程更难落实</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传中传代表事情的经过。若中传旬空，常见中间环节落空、承诺不到位或周转接不上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：辛酉日属<strong>甲寅旬，空子丑</strong>，本盘中传恰是<strong>子水旬空</strong>。这进一步提醒：借款、回款或还款的中间环节容易断档。若必须操作，应先把来源、去向、期限和凭据写清，不宜凭口头承诺贸然周转。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：不宜借贷求财，须防拆借还债、账目不明与中途断档</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 辛金以木为财　② 干上卯、支上寅都是财　③ 借来的钱同时也是债，不等于净得　④ 中传子空，防周转环节落空</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·借钱还债格</p>\n<hr>", "q6": "<h3 id=\"例6-辛丑日-双方各带一份财-旬空-六亲-主客\">【例6】辛丑日 · 双方各带一份财 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>主客</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：交车合财 · 辛丑日第十一局，干上子为支财、支上卯为干财</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>辛丑日</strong>来问合作求财：这桩生意适不适合双方一起做？本盘不是单看&quot;我的财&quot;，而是看干支两边能不能互相带财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　妻财　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　天后　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　父母　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>卯 → 巳 → 未</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>辛金，干上 <strong>子</strong>；<strong>日支</strong>丑土，支上与发用都是 <strong>卯</strong>。辛丑属甲午旬，空辰巳。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先懂什么叫&quot;交车&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：六壬常以日干代表自己、日支代表对方或所占之事。若干上的神与日支发生关系、支上的神又与日干发生关系，就像双方交换位置、彼此搭上线，叫<strong>交车</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘干上是<strong>子水</strong>，它不直接当辛金的财，而要拿去和日支丑土比较；支上是<strong>卯木</strong>，则拿来和日干辛金比较。两边正好交叉看。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　交叉以后，两边都是财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：六亲不只可以日干为中心教学；在交车格里，还要看干上神是不是支的财、支上神是不是干的财。若双方各自见财，便叫<strong>交车合财</strong>，适合以钱货、资本、利润来合作交涉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丑属<strong>土</strong>，土克水，所以干上<strong>子水是丑支之财</strong>；辛属<strong>金</strong>，金克木，所以支上<strong>卯木是辛干之财</strong>。双方各带一枚对方可用之财，原著因此断&quot;<strong>宜交关取财</strong>&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　合作可谈，中间环节仍要落纸</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：格局说明合作方向有利，三传则补充事情怎样发展。中传若空，常见流程中段、手续或承诺一时悬空，不能因为大方向吉就省掉核实。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：发用卯本就是辛金之财，合作由财启动；但中传<strong>巳火旬空</strong>（辛丑属甲午旬、空辰巳），中途执行可能有反复。适合合作取财，但应把分工、出资、交付和分账写清，避免好合作卡在手续上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：宜合作求财、以财交涉；中途手续与分账须落实（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 日干可代表我、日支可代表对方　② 干上与支、支上与干交叉看叫交车　③ 子为丑土之财、卯为辛金之财　④ 交车合财利合作，仍防中传巳空</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·交车合财</p>\n<hr>", "q7": "<h3 id=\"例7-丙戌日-财走进墓里-旬空-墓神\">【例7】丙戌日 · 财走进墓里 <code>旬空</code> <code>墓神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：财神传墓格 · 丙戌日第八局昼占（据书图三传申丑午注入）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙戌日</strong>占求财。财一开始就出现，却立刻走进自己的墓库，适合用来分辨&quot;有财象&quot;和&quot;财能流通&quot;不是一回事。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">己　子孙　太阴</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">兄弟　青龙　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>申 → 丑 → 午</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>丙火，干上 <strong>戌</strong>、支上 <strong>卯</strong>，发用是 <strong>申</strong>。丙戌属甲申旬，空午未。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　财确实发用了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：丙属火，火克金，所以丙日以金为财。财在初传发用，说明求财是事情当下最先冒出的主题；但这只回答&quot;财有没有出现&quot;，还没回答&quot;能不能流到手里&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：初传<strong>申属金</strong>，正是丙火之财，而且申从第四课上神发用。财当头出现，表面上看确有财事发动。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　新知识：财传进了墓</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：十二地支里，每种五行都有收束它的墓库。墓像仓库或坟墓：能收藏，也会让事物闭塞、不流动。金的墓在<strong>丑</strong>；财从前一传走到自己的墓，就叫<strong>财神传墓</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘初传申金之后，紧接着就是中传<strong>丑</strong>。申金财由初传走入丑墓，好比钱刚露头便被锁进库房，形成<strong>财气闭塞</strong>：账有、货有或机会有，却难周转、难变现。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　末传又空，结果更难落袋</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：末传代表结果。末传若旬空，事情最后的承接力不足；若前面又已入墓，就更像先被封存、最后再落空。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙戌日属<strong>甲申旬，空午未</strong>，末传恰为<strong>午火旬空</strong>。所以普通求财不宜乐观，容易卡在冻结、审批、库存或回款上；若所占本来就是结清、封存财物，墓的&quot;收束&quot;作用才可另作具体判断。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：财气闭塞，求财难畅、回款变现受阻</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 丙火以金为财　② 初传申是财、并非干上　③ 金墓在丑，申财传丑即财神传墓　④ 末传午空，结果更难落实</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·财神传墓格</p>\n<hr>", "q8": "<h3 id=\"例8-乙巳日-财被两鬼看守-六亲\">【例8】乙巳日 · 财被两鬼看守 <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：鬼护财格① · 乙巳日第十二局，三传未申酉、未财有申酉鬼护（财安稳、取之必危）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>乙巳日</strong>来占一笔看得见的财。财本身没有被比肩争走，却夹在两个官鬼旁边，像一只箱子完好无损、门口却站着危险的守卫。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　妻财　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　官鬼　太常</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">己　官鬼　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>未 → 申 → 酉</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>乙木，干上 <strong>巳</strong>、支上 <strong>午</strong>，发用 <strong>未</strong>。乙巳属甲辰旬，空寅卯，三传都不空。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　三传里先分清财和鬼</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：以日干为我，&quot;我克者妻财、克我者官鬼&quot;。同一条三传里可以同时出现财与鬼，不能看见一枚财就忽略旁边会不会克我的神。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：乙属<strong>木</strong>，木克土，所以初传<strong>未土是财</strong>；金克木，所以中传<strong>申金</strong>、末传<strong>酉金</strong>都是克乙木的官鬼。格局就是一财带着两鬼。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　为什么叫&quot;鬼护财&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：兄弟、比肩常有分夺财物之象；官鬼虽会伤我，却也能压住争财者。因此财旁有鬼，有时表示钱不容易被别人抢走，财本身反而守得很稳。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：未财后面紧跟申、酉两鬼，没有比肩来夺财，故原著说<strong>财有鬼护、安稳无破</strong>。换成白话：钱可能真实存在，也有人把守，别人不容易拿走。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　财稳，不代表我取财安全</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：判断求财要同时问两件事：<strong>钱稳不稳</strong>，以及<strong>我靠近它会不会受伤</strong>。鬼能护财，也照样克我；若只见财稳便上前取，容易把风险漏掉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：申金、酉金都克乙木，且三传不空，鬼有实力。于是这笔财虽稳，<strong>取财的人却要过鬼关</strong>，可能伴随官非、压力、强势控制或危险条件。原著结论很克制：识事者不取其财。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：财虽安稳，取之必危；不宜为财冒险</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 乙木克未土＝财　② 申酉金克乙木＝鬼　③ 鬼可压住夺财者，所以财稳　④ 鬼也克我，所以钱稳不等于取钱安全</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·鬼护财格①</p>\n<hr>", "q9": "<h3 id=\"例9-丙申日-财藏在整片鬼局里-旬空-六亲\">【例9】丙申日 · 财藏在整片鬼局里 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：鬼护财格② · 丙申日第五局（巳时丑将），三传子申辰（申子辰水局）俱鬼、辰旬空、独存申金财（危中出财、取之不安）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙申日</strong>巳时占财。三传整体合成克我的水局，但中间又藏着一枚申金财；这类盘最怕只挑有利的一个字，不看它身处什么大环境。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　官鬼　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　妻财　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">子孙　青龙　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong>，整体是申子辰水局；<strong>日干</strong>丙火，干上 <strong>丑</strong>、支上 <strong>辰</strong>，发用 <strong>子</strong>。丙申属甲午旬，只空辰巳。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先看整体：申子辰合水局</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传凑成三合局时，整体气势优先。申子辰三合水；水克火，所以对丙火日干而言，这片水局整体是<strong>官鬼</strong>，代表压力、风险和克制。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘三传子、申、辰三字齐全，正是<strong>申子辰水局</strong>。水克丙火，因此求财的大环境不是轻松财局，而是<strong>鬼局压身</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　再看单字：鬼局中藏着申金财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：看整体不等于抹掉单个传神。丙火克金，金仍是丙日之财；若财夹在鬼局中，就是钱确实可能出现，但它被风险环境包围。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：中传<strong>申属金</strong>，是丙火之财；初传子属水，是实在的鬼。于是形成<strong>鬼局中见财</strong>：财并非没有，但要从一片克我的水势里取出，所得难安。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　旬空必须按本盘重算，不能照抄旧注</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：古书注解若与旬空算法冲突，要以日旬复核。丙申日在甲午旬，旬空只有<strong>辰、巳</strong>；不能把不空的字也说成空，否则会把风险误删掉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘只有末传<strong>辰空</strong>，初传<strong>子水鬼并不空</strong>。旧注中把子鬼也说空，是书误；按实盘看，鬼的压力仍在。因此不能断成&quot;只剩申财可取&quot;，而应断<strong>财从险中出、纵得也不安稳</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：财从危险中出，纵得也不安稳，不宜强取</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 申子辰整体合水局　② 水克丙火为鬼局　③ 中传申金仍是丙火之财　④ 丙申旬空辰巳，子鬼不空，须校正书误</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·鬼护财格②</p>\n<hr>", "q10": "<h3 id=\"例10-己丑日-尽力生财却像替人还债-旬空-六亲-取象-应期\">【例10】己丑日 · 尽力生财却像替人还债 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>取象</code> <code>应期</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：取还魂债格 · 己丑日第九局，三传酉丑巳金局脱气反生干上亥财（尽力还债）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>己丑日</strong>占财。三传确实一路把力量送到财上，但所用的力量全从日干泄出去，像自己忙前忙后，最后只是把别人的账填平。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　子孙　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">己　兄弟　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　父母　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong>，整体是巳酉丑金局；<strong>日干</strong>己土，干上 <strong>亥</strong>、支上 <strong>巳</strong>，发用 <strong>酉</strong>。己丑属甲申旬，空午未，财与三传都不空。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　三传先合成什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：巳酉丑三字齐全，整体合成金局。以日干为我，&quot;我生者子孙&quot;，也叫<strong>脱气</strong>：我把力量生出去，自己的气便被消耗。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：己属<strong>土</strong>，土生金；本盘三传酉、丑、巳合成<strong>巳酉丑金局</strong>，所以整条三传都是己土向外生出的子孙、脱气。事情从头到尾都在消耗自己。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　脱气又去生干上的财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：五行可以连续相生：我生出去的神，若再去生财，就像我投入时间、体力和成本，把财养起来。财得到生助不假，但必须追问<strong>这份财最终归谁、投入是否划算</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：己土克水，所以水是己日之财；干上正是<strong>亥水财</strong>。金能生水，于是三传金局一边泄己土，一边生起干上亥财，形成<strong>脱我生财</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为什么比作&quot;还债&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：若整件事只有自己的耗泄落实，财却只是被养大、未必回到自己手里，便像替别人出力还账。看见&quot;生财&quot;不能立刻报吉，还要把投入成本和财的归属一起算。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘三传与亥财都不旬空，说明耗力与财事都是真实的；问题在于力量流向是<strong>己土 → 金局 → 亥水财</strong>，自己不断向外付出。故原著取象&quot;<strong>尽力还他人债</strong>&quot;：求财易变成做工、垫资或填旧账，得不偿耗。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：尽力还债；求财多见自己耗力垫资，收益未必归己</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 巳酉丑整体合金局　② 己土生金，三传为子孙脱气　③ 干上亥水是己土之财　④ 金局生亥财＝脱我生财，须核算投入与归属</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·取还魂债格</p>\n<hr>", "q11": "<h3 id=\"例11-壬午日-弃开坏传反能取财-旬空-六亲-类神\">【例11】壬午日 · 弃开坏传反能取财 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：避难逃生得财格 · 壬午日第八局，弃三传就干上午财</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>壬午日</strong>占求财。三传从头到尾都帮不上忙，若硬沿着三传追会越看越坏；本格教人舍开无益之传，回到日干与日支的直接关系找出路。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　官鬼　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">父母　勾陈　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　子孙　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>辰 → 酉 → 寅</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>壬水，干上 <strong>辰</strong>、支上 <strong>亥</strong>，发用 <strong>辰</strong>。壬午属甲戌旬，空申酉；壬干寄宫亥落在地盘午。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　三传为什么都不值得追</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：遇到三传全是墓、空、脱等无益之神时，不必死抱三传。<strong>墓</strong>主闭塞，<strong>空</strong>主无实，<strong>脱气</strong>主消耗；连续出现，表示沿原路径推进没有好处。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：初传<strong>辰土</strong>克壬水，又是水墓，既压我又收我；中传<strong>酉金旬空</strong>（壬午属甲戌旬、空申酉）；末传<strong>寅木</strong>是壬水所生的子孙、会泄我，而且寅落在地盘酉空位上，属于<strong>落空</strong>。三传确实一路无益。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　新知识：舍开三传，另找能落脚的位置</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：&quot;避难逃生&quot;不是把坏象说成没有，而是识别原路线不可走，转向盘里能让我得到生助或实际收益的位置。此时必须把<strong>干上</strong>和<strong>日干寄宫落到哪里</strong>分清。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘<strong>干上是辰</strong>，不是午；但壬干寄在亥宫，天盘亥正好落到地盘<strong>午</strong>，同时支上也是亥。这叫&quot;<strong>壬干加午</strong>&quot;，表示壬水贴到午支上，而午火正是壬水能克的财。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为什么只有占财可取</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：同一结构换占问，所取类神会改变。这里的出路恰好是日干临到日支之财，所以只在求财问题上显出收益；不能把它泛化成所有事情都吉。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：壬属<strong>水</strong>，水克火，日支<strong>午火就是财</strong>。舍开墓、空、脱的三传，转由壬水直接取午火之财，故曰&quot;<strong>避难求财</strong>&quot;。若问宅事，亥水临午反有上神克支之象，便不能照搬求财吉断。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：避开无益路径，求财反可得；此吉只针对财占（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 辰为水墓并克壬　② 酉旬空、寅脱气又落空　③ 干上辰，不可误说干上午　④ 壬干寄宫亥临午支财，舍传可取</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·避难逃生得财格</p>\n<hr>", "q12": "<h3 id=\"例12-丙午日-看似有人生我却全空-旬空-六亲-应期\">【例12】丙午日 · 看似有人生我却全空 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>应期</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：费多得少格 · 丙午日第四局，生干之神逢空，二四课见鬼贼（据书图三传子酉午注入）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙午日</strong>占投入能否换来收益。盘面表层有寅卯木来生丙火，看似有人、有资源扶持；但生助全空，真正落地的却是压力和花费。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">己　妻财　太阴</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　兄弟　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>子 → 酉 → 午</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>丙火，干上 <strong>寅</strong>、支上 <strong>卯</strong>，发用 <strong>子</strong>。丙午属甲辰旬，旬空寅卯。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先看表面的好处：干支上都来生我</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：生我者为<strong>父母</strong>，代表扶持、资源、文书或本钱。干上与支上都见生神，本来像自己和外部都有人托举，是一层好象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙属<strong>火</strong>，木生火；干上<strong>寅木</strong>、支上<strong>卯木</strong>都能生丙火，表面正是&quot;支干全生&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　但生助全落空，鬼却是真的</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：吉神逢空，就像承诺、资源或靠山只有名义而不能出力；反过来，克我的官鬼若不空，压力便会真实落下。判断时要比较哪一边实、哪一边虚。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙午属<strong>甲辰旬，空寅卯</strong>，所以两枚生神偏偏全空。第二课上神<strong>亥水</strong>、第四课上神<strong>子水</strong>都克丙火，是官鬼，而且不空。结果是<strong>帮助虚、压力实</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　落实到财，就是花得多、得得少</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财看收益，也要把为得到收益付出的成本算进去。生助不落实、鬼来压身时，常见项目需要不断追加时间、钱和精力，最后所得不足以覆盖花费。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传又以子水鬼发用，事情先从压力、催逼或支出发动；中传酉金虽是丙火之财，却处在鬼后，难抵前面的消耗。故原著断<strong>得之不足、费之有余</strong>，也就是今天说的投入产出不划算。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：所得不足、费用有余，求财得不偿失</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 木生火，寅卯本是丙火父母生神　② 丙午旬空寅卯，帮助成虚　③ 亥子水克丙火为实鬼　④ 求财须看净收益，不只看有没有财</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·费多得少格</p>\n<hr>", "q13": "<h3 id=\"例13-丙寅日-财一发用就被破-旬空-类神\">【例13】丙寅日 · 财一发用就被破 <code>旬空</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：用破格 · 丙寅日第十局，申财发用受夹克，中末空陷（据书图三传申亥寅注入）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙寅日</strong>占求财。初传就是财，看起来比许多盘更直接；但财脚下受克，后续又接不起来，是典型的&quot;财出现了，却没有实得&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　父母　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>丙火，干上与发用都是 <strong>申</strong>，支上 <strong>巳</strong>。丙寅属甲子旬，空戌亥。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　财确实临干发用</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：丙火克金，所以金是丙日之财。财既在干上又发用，表示钱财贴近自己、并成为事情的开端；但这仍只是第一眼，接着要看它站得稳不稳。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘<strong>干上申金</strong>，初传也是<strong>申金</strong>，财贴身发动。位置上没有混淆：这次干上与发用恰好相同。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　财脚下的地盘在克它</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：天盘的字要看它落在哪个地盘上。若用神坐在克它的位置，就像钱放在会消耗、破坏它的环境里，称为受克、用破。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：此局天盘<strong>申金落在地盘巳火</strong>，火克金，所以申财一出现便受脚下巳火克制。财虽近身，却根基受损，难成完整收益。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　中末没有把事情接实</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：用神受破后，若中末传再逢旬空或落空，后续也没有修复力量，常见报价、机会或账面利润最后变成虚数。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙寅属<strong>甲子旬，空戌亥</strong>，中传<strong>亥旬空</strong>；末传寅虽不旬空，却落在地盘亥空位上，属于<strong>落空</strong>。于是初财受克、中空、末陷，原著总结为&quot;<strong>虚财虚得</strong>&quot;——看似有财，实际无实得。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：虚财虚得，求财无实得、身心徒劳</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 丙火以金为财　② 本盘干上与发用都是申　③ 申金落巳火地受克＝用破　④ 中亥旬空、末寅落空，后续无实</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·用破格</p>\n<hr>", "q14": "<h3 id=\"例14-甲子日-财兼宅墓压在支上-旬空\">【例14】甲子日 · 财兼宅墓压在支上 <code>旬空</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：支墓作财格（一）· 甲子日第九局，辰为支墓又作日财发用（据书图三传辰申子注入）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲子日</strong>占经商求财。初传确实是财，却同时是日支的墓，钱与家宅、货场或行程被一并收住，适合辨认&quot;财发用也可能闭塞&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　官鬼　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　父母　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>甲木，干上 <strong>午</strong>、支上与发用都是 <strong>辰</strong>。甲子旬空戌亥，三传不空。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　辰首先是甲木之财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：甲属木，木克土，所以甲日以土为财。财临支上并发用，说明财事从对方、货物、场所或家宅这一端先发动。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：支上和初传都是<strong>辰土</strong>，被甲木所克，确实是财。这里要准确说：<strong>干上是午</strong>，辰是<strong>支上兼发用</strong>，不是干上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　同一个辰又是日支子的墓</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：水的墓在辰。日支可代表宅、对方、货物落脚处或旅途所往；支的墓压到支上并发用，就像这部分被装进库房，主闭塞、停顿。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：日支<strong>子属水</strong>，水墓正是<strong>辰</strong>。于是初传辰一身两职：对甲木是财，对子支又是墓。这就叫&quot;<strong>支墓作财</strong>&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为什么经商和行路尤其不利</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财需要资金、货物和信息流动；墓却把支这一端收住。若占商旅，常应在货压、回款慢、路线受阻或对方不动，财虽有名却难周转。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：辰墓临支发用，事情一开始便从对方或场所端闭住。原著断商贩<strong>折本</strong>、在路<strong>阻程</strong>、诸谋塞滞不通。三传虽又成申子辰水局，也不能抹去发用辰兼支墓的核心闭塞。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：商贩防折本、货财闭塞，旅程与谋事多阻</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 甲木克辰土为财　② 干上午，支上与发用辰，位置须分清　③ 子水墓在辰　④ 支墓作财主商旅折本、路程阻滞</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·支墓作财格</p>\n<hr>", "q15": "<h3 id=\"例15-甲寅日-自己与对方都来争财-六亲-课体\">【例15】甲寅日 · 自己与对方都来争财 <code>六亲</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：支干同类格 · 甲寅日第一局昼占（据书图三传寅巳申注入）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲寅日</strong>占求财。日干甲木、日支寅木本属同类，天地盘又伏吟不动；没有谁把资源让出来，双方更像站在同一条线上竞争。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　兄弟　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　子孙　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　官鬼　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>为 <strong>寅 → 巳 → 申</strong>；<strong>日干</strong>甲木，干上、日支、支上与发用都是 <strong>寅</strong>。月将与占时同为午，天地盘伏吟。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　什么叫支干同类</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：日干代表我，日支常代表对方或事情。两边五行相同，六亲上属于<strong>兄弟、比肩</strong>；求财时，比肩常有竞争、分夺、各不相让之象。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：日干<strong>甲属木</strong>，日支<strong>寅也属木</strong>，干支同类。双方力量性质相同，不是我克住一枚财，而是两边站成竞争者。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　伏吟让&quot;各守各位&quot;更明显</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：月将和占时相同，天地盘十二支原位重合，称为<strong>伏吟</strong>。伏吟常见事情不动、重复、各守原处；配合同类竞争，就更难迅速分出利益归属。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘午将午时，天盘地盘完全重合；干上、支上、发用全是<strong>寅</strong>。自己与对方像各守原位、谁也不退，求财自然容易陷入争夺和僵持。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为何断求财难得</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财最怕比肩争财：即便后面出现财机，也可能被竞争者分走，或在分配中耗散。此时重点不只是找财，而是先解决权属与分配。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：原著列甲寅等十二个干支同类日，直断&quot;<strong>支干各相争夺，难求财</strong>&quot;。实际决策上，应先约定份额、产权和退出条件；若利益边界不清，越合作越容易变成争财。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：支干相争，求财难得，须先定权属与分配</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 日干为我、日支可看对方　② 干支同五行属比肩同类　③ 比肩在求财中主分夺竞争　④ 午将午时为伏吟，各守原位更难取财</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·支干同类格</p>\n<hr>", "q16": "<h3 id=\"例16-甲寅日-贪一粒米-失半年粮-贪小失大-刑冲破害\">【例16】甲寅日 · 贪一粒米、失半年粮(贪小失大) <code>刑冲破害</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：得少失多格 · 甲寅日第十二局，干上卯为日旺神、却被三传辰(卯辰害)巳午(泄卯木)牵引耗损(贪小失大)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲寅日</strong>来占求财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　妻财　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　子孙　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　子孙　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>辰 → 巳 → 午</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>甲</strong>(木)；干上 <strong>卯</strong>(甲之旺神)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　求财先看自己的旺气</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财先看日干旺不旺——手里本有的旺气足，才撑得起财。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看干上坐的神，对日干甲来说是旺是衰。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　握着旺气、却被小利牵着耗</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：干上<strong>卯</strong>是甲木的<strong>旺神</strong>(旺气在手、本有底子)。再看三传把它往哪牵。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传辰巳午一路牵引：初传<strong>辰</strong>(甲之财、看着像块小利)却与卯<strong>六害</strong>(卯辰相害)、中末<strong>巳午</strong>又<strong>盗泄</strong>卯木(木生火＝旺气往外漏)。为够那点辰的小利，把卯的旺气一路泄光。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：得少失多＝贪小失大。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：&quot;贪他一粒米、失却半年粮&quot;——为眼前一点小利，反把大本钱耗掉，求财得不偿失。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：贪小失大、得不偿失</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求财先看日干旺气(干上卯＝甲旺神)　② 三传辰害卯、巳午泄卯＝旺气被牵着耗　③ 得少失多＝贪一粒米失半年粮　④ 为小利耗大本、求财得不偿失</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·得少失多格</p>\n<hr>", "q17": "<h3 id=\"例17-庚辰日-求财大获-六亲-类神\">【例17】⭐ 庚辰日 · 求财大获 <code>六亲</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：求财大获 · 庚辰日第八局，三传寅未子（皆作日财）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：有人在<strong>庚辰日</strong>来问：我这趟财，能不能得、能得多少？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　父母　天空</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　子孙　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>（盘中<q class=\"yw\">初/中/末</q>）是 <strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong>，<strong>日干</strong>是 <strong>庚</strong>。下面一步步拆。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找&quot;财&quot;在哪 —— 这就是&quot;取用神&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占求财，第一件事是找&quot;钱&quot;在盘里是哪个字——这个代表所占之事的字叫<strong>用神</strong>。求财的用神是<strong>妻财</strong>。口诀&quot;<strong>我克者妻财</strong>&quot;：我能管住、拿得住的，就是我的财。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：套到这个盘：庚是<strong>金</strong>，金克<strong>木</strong>，所以对庚日，<strong>木就是财</strong>。看三传 <strong>寅</strong>未子——<strong>寅属木，寅就是这盘里的&quot;财&quot;</strong>！而且它站在<strong>初传（发用）</strong>，是全盘的当头炮。财一上来就当头，说明<strong>这事的核心就是钱、财还主动冒出来</strong>——好兆头。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　这财我拿得住吗 —— 看&quot;生克&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：找到财，还要看<strong>你和财的关系</strong>。财被你克住（我克者），说明<strong>财归你管、拿得住</strong>；若财反来克你、或你克不动它，就未必到手。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘里庚（金）正好克寅（木）——<strong>财被你牢牢克住、攥在手里</strong>，这叫&quot;财为我所用&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　这事怎么发展 —— 读&quot;三传&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传是事情的&quot;剧本&quot;——<strong>初传</strong>=起因/现在，<strong>中传</strong>=经过，<strong>末传</strong>=结果；还要看三传之间<strong>相生还是相克</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看这盘：<strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong>，而且<strong>庚克寅、寅克未、未克子</strong>，一路克下去。飘管这叫&quot;<strong>财气流转</strong>&quot;——财从头到尾被一层层克住、层层归拢到你手里，没漏出去。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：求财可以大获（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 求财取妻财　② 妻财=我克者（庚日财是木）　③ 发用/初传的意义　④ 三传递克&quot;流转&quot;</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·求财大获格</p>\n<hr>", "q18": "<h3 id=\"例18-辛亥日-财落空亡-旬空-六亲-类神\">【例18】⭐ 辛亥日 · 财落空亡 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：财神空亡格 · 辛亥日第九局，干上寅、支上卯二财皆空</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：另一个人<strong>辛亥日</strong>来问求财。这次盘里明明有财，结果却相反——正好和上一例对照着学。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　父母　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　子孙　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　玄武　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>是 <strong>未 → 亥 → 卯</strong>，<strong>日干</strong>是 <strong>辛</strong>；第一课上神（干上）是 <strong>寅</strong>、日支上神是 <strong>卯</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找&quot;财&quot; —— 一样先取用神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：还是老规矩：求财取<strong>妻财</strong>，&quot;我克者妻财&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：辛是<strong>金</strong>，金克<strong>木</strong>，所以辛日<strong>木是财</strong>。这盘里干上<strong>寅</strong>、支上<strong>卯</strong>都是木——<strong>看起来有两个财</strong>，比上一例还多，是不是该更得财？先别急。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　关键一步：看财&quot;空&quot;了没 —— 空亡</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：找到财，必须再看它<strong>空亡</strong>没有。<strong>空亡</strong>=这个字落在本旬&quot;缺的位置&quot;上，等于<strong>是个空壳、看得见摸不着、抓不住</strong>。查空亡先看日在哪一旬：辛亥日属<strong>甲辰旬</strong>，甲辰旬空的正是 <strong>寅、卯</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：坏就坏在这——盘里那两个财 <strong>寅、卯偏偏全都空亡</strong>！财是有，可全是空的。原文说得直白：&quot;<strong>见在之财已空，求外来之财岂有得也</strong>&quot;（眼前的财都是空的，还想求额外的财？）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　这事怎么收场</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：用神（财）空亡，事情就往&quot;落空&quot;走——不但成不了，往往还要倒搭进去。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：两财皆空，求不到反而破费——这就是为什么同样&quot;盘里有财&quot;，这一例和上一例结果天差地别。<strong>关键不在有没有财，而在财空不空</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：求财反费己财（不但得不到，反倒破财）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 找到财还要看空亡　② 空亡=空壳抓不住　③ 用神空则事落空　④ 查空亡先看日在哪一旬（辛亥属甲辰旬·空寅卯）</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·财神空亡格</p>\n<hr>", "q19": "<h3 id=\"例19-丙戌日-天将生财-六亲-天将-德合禄马\">【例19】⭐ 丙戌日 · 天将生财 <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>德合禄马</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：将生财神格 · 丙戌日第九局（夜占），三传酉丑巳作财、天将又生财</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙戌日</strong>夜里来占求财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　妻财　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">己　子孙　太常</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　兄弟　勾陈</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong>是 <strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丙</strong>，夜占。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找&quot;财&quot; —— 取用神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：老规矩：求财取<strong>妻财</strong>，&quot;我克者妻财&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙是<strong>火</strong>，火克<strong>金</strong>，所以丙日<strong>金是财</strong>。看三传 <strong>巳、酉、丑</strong>——单看巳是火、丑是土，可这三个字凑在一起，正好<strong>三合成一个&quot;金局&quot;</strong>（巳酉丑合金）！整条三传合起来化作一大块金＝财，这叫&quot;<strong>三传作财</strong>&quot;。<strong>（三合局</strong>：申子辰合水、亥卯未合木、寅午戌合火、巳酉丑合金——三个特定地支凑齐就合化成一种五行，看的是<strong>整体</strong>、不是单个字。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　新东西：看&quot;天将&quot;生不生财</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：盘里每个字头上，还坐着一位<strong>天将</strong>（贵人、青龙、太常…十二天将之一）。天将也<strong>各有自己的五行</strong>，会按五行去<strong>添力或拆台</strong>它脚下的字——生它就是添柴、克它就是泼水。要判断天将是生是克，<strong>先得知道这位天将属什么五行</strong>。（十二天将五行：贵人土、螣蛇火、朱雀火、六合木、勾陈土、青龙木、天空土、白虎金、太常土、玄武水、太阴金、天后水。）</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘的财是<strong>巳酉丑合成的&quot;金局&quot;</strong>——能生金的是<strong>土</strong>（土生金）。再看财头上乘的天将：初传酉上乘<strong>贵人（土）</strong>、中传丑上乘<strong>太常（土）</strong>——正好都是<strong>土将</strong>！<strong>土将生金财</strong>（原文&quot;天将又生财神&quot;），好比财本身够壮、背后还站着人给它添柴，<strong>财得天将生助、力上加力</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　三传怎么走</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：三传是剧本：初→中→末，看它聚不聚。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：巳酉丑合成一整块&quot;金局&quot;财、又被天将生着，<strong>财气聚成一团、旺而不散</strong>，从头旺到尾。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：大宜取财（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 三传作财　② 天将会生助/克制它脚下的字　③ 用神得天将生助则力更足　④ 财旺得生宜取</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·将生财神格</p>\n<hr>", "q20": "<h3 id=\"例20-乙未日-财到宜速取-六亲-应期\">【例20】⭐ 乙未日 · 财到宜速取 <code>六亲</code> <code>应期</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：求财急取格 · 乙未日第十局，未加乙财临干上、未为乙墓（宜速取）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>乙未日</strong>来占求财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　妻财　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　妻财　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　妻财　天后</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>未 → 戌 → 丑</strong>（都是土），<strong>日干</strong> <strong>乙</strong>；第一课上神（干上）就是 <strong>未</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找&quot;财&quot; —— 取用神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财取<strong>妻财</strong>，&quot;我克者妻财&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：乙是<strong>木</strong>，木克<strong>土</strong>，所以乙日<strong>土是财</strong>。干上正坐着<strong>未</strong>土＝财，而且它紧贴日干——这叫&quot;<strong>财来就人</strong>&quot;，财主动送到你手边，本是大好事。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　新东西：这财带个&quot;墓&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这里要认一个新字眼——<strong>墓</strong>。墓像一间收东西的<strong>库房</strong>：东西一进去就被收起来、锁住、暗昧不明。每个日干都有自己的墓（乙木的墓正是<strong>未</strong>）。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：坏就坏在——干上这个财 <strong>未，恰恰又是乙木的墓</strong>。等于钱送到眼前，旁边却有个库房随时要把它收走关起来。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　那怎么办 —— 看&quot;时机&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：断事不光看成不成，还看<strong>该快还是该等</strong>，这叫<strong>应期</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：财带墓，就得&quot;<strong>速取</strong>&quot;——趁财还在手边赶紧拿；拿慢了，财被墓收走，反而生祸（原文&quot;如缓则财反被未来墓其乙木、却恐为祸&quot;）。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：惟宜速去取之（快取则得、缓则反祸）（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 财贴日干＝&quot;财来就人&quot;　② 墓＝收东西的库房、进去就被锁　③ 财带墓宜&quot;速取&quot;　④ 断事还要看时机（应期）</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·求财急取格</p>\n<hr>", "q21": "<h3 id=\"例21-甲辰日-危中取财-六亲\">【例21】⭐ 甲辰日 · 危中取财 <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：危中取财格 · 甲辰日第九局，甲克辰为财、辰上乘申鬼克干（危中取财）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲辰日</strong>来占求财。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　官鬼　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　父母　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　妻财　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>申 → 子 → 辰</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>甲</strong>；这次财不在三传，而在<strong>日支</strong>——日支 <strong>辰</strong> 土。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先找&quot;财&quot; —— 取用神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：求财取<strong>妻财</strong>，&quot;我克者妻财&quot;。财不一定都在三传，也可能在日干、日支上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：甲是<strong>木</strong>，木克<strong>土</strong>，所以甲日<strong>土是财</strong>。这盘的财，是<strong>日支的辰土</strong>（甲克辰）——财是有的。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　新东西：财头上压着个&quot;鬼&quot;</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：再认一个关键字眼——<strong>鬼</strong>。跟&quot;我克者是财&quot;相反，<strong>克我者就是鬼</strong>（威胁、凶险、麻烦）。要看财的<strong>处境</strong>：它头上坐的是帮手还是鬼。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看这盘：辰财头上，坐着一个 <strong>申</strong> 金。申金克甲木——<strong>克我，就是鬼</strong>。财是有，可财头上正压着个会咬我的鬼，取这财等于虎口里拔食。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　那这财还取不取</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：财有、鬼也在旁，就是&quot;能得、但有险&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以断&quot;<strong>危中取财</strong>&quot;——财取得到，但过程惊险、不免自惊（原文&quot;不免自惊、危中取财&quot;）。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：危中取财（能取到、但有惊险）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 克我者＝&quot;鬼&quot;（威胁）　② 财旁有鬼＝取财有险　③ &quot;危中取财&quot;有惊　④ 除了找财，还要看财的&quot;处境&quot;（头上是帮手还是鬼）</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《大六壬通解》中册·危中取财格</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q22": "<h3 id=\"例22-乙亥日-三传和日上夹着一个字-那就是要讨的钱-课体-年命-天将-六亲\">【例22】乙亥日 · 三传和日上夹着一个字，那就是要讨的钱 <code>课体</code> <code>年命</code> <code>天将</code> <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：元首课（进连茹）· 乙亥日巳将辰时 · 三传丑寅卯逐位而进，与日上巳之间夹拱一个辰</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：戊寅年七月<strong>乙亥日</strong>辰时，<strong>有所为而占</strong>（占者没说来意）。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 拱夹之字＝真正所问的东西 / 进茹＝事情未了 / 丑为病符（旧太岁）＝旧事 / 末传归禄作六合＝终有所得</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　妻财　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　兄弟　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">己　兄弟　六合</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>丑 → 寅 → 卯</strong> 逐位<strong>而进</strong>（进连茹）；三传与<strong>日上巳</strong>之间<strong>夹拱一个辰</strong>——<strong>辰正是乙日的财</strong>；占者<strong>行年在辰</strong>；初传<strong>丑乘螣蛇</strong>；末传<strong>卯为乙之禄、作六合</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 来意不明时，看三传夹拱出什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占者不说所问，就找<strong>盘上被夹住、却没露面的那个字</strong>——<strong>拱夹之神常常正是这件事的正主</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：三传丑寅卯连着日上巳，中间<strong>空缺一个辰</strong>；<strong>辰是乙日的财</strong> ⇒ 断这件事<strong>是为钱</strong>。又占者<strong>行年正在辰</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\"><strong>身即是财</strong></q>，这笔钱与他本人直接相关。⭐ 原文赞<q class=\"yw\">奇妙奇妙</q>，妙就妙在<strong>没露面的那个字才是主角</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　这事进行到哪一步：进茹</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>进连茹</strong>主一串事情<strong>正在往前走、还没走完</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>进茹主事尚不了</strong></q>⇒ 事情尚未了结。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为什么是旧事：丑为病符</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>丑为病符（又名旧太岁）</strong>，主<strong>旧事重提</strong>；乘<strong>螣蛇</strong>则主惊疑不定。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>丑乘螣蛇，因旧年事惊疑</strong></q>⇒ 这笔账是<strong>旧年欠下的</strong>，占者心里七上八下。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　结果如何：末传归禄作六合</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>末传是收局</strong>。归到<strong>日禄</strong>又作<strong>六合</strong>（合主成、主得），就是终究有着落。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>末传归禄作六合，将吉</strong></q>⇒ 断<strong>终有所得</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>进茹主事尚不了</strong>，末传<strong>归禄作六合</strong>，将吉，<strong>丑乘螣蛇，因旧年事惊疑</strong>，进而寅卯比日更奇者，<strong>夹定虚一所欠者财</strong>，然<strong>行年在辰为补欠</strong>，奇妙奇妙。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：三传进茹（事尚未了）＋丑为病符乘螣蛇（旧年之事·心中惊疑）＋三传与日上夹拱辰·辰为乙日之财且行年在辰（所问正是这笔欠款）＋末传归禄作六合（终有所得）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：占的是一笔旧年欠款；事情还没了，但末传归禄逢合，终究讨得回来</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① ⭐ 来意不明看夹拱之字——没露面的常是正主　② 进茹＝事未了；退茹＝已折回　③ 丑为病符（旧太岁）＝旧事　④ 末传归禄作六合＝有着落</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例二十一（郭御青占，《郭氏占案》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p289｜PDF p1021〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q23": "<h3 id=\"例23-戊寅日-家里会送钱来-连-七两四钱-都算出来了-应期-类神-天将-课体\">【例23】⭐ 戊寅日 · 家里会送钱来——连<q class=\"yw\">七两四钱</q>都算出来了 <code>应期</code> <code>类神</code> <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：返吟（无依）· 戊寅日亥将巳时 · 三传寅申寅往复，财爻朱雀加干，驿马在中传</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：崇祯丁丑年二月初八<strong>戊寅日</strong>巳时，郭御青在京城替姻亲张贞明占<strong>会试考场之事</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：反吟主速 / 财爻乘朱雀加干＝钱与信一起来 / 驿马在中传＝有人上路 / ⭐ 断具体数目：类神之数相加 / ⚠️ 定数是壬课最难处</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　官鬼　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">子孙　青龙　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　官鬼　天后</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：课体<strong>返吟</strong>（往复、速）；<strong>财爻乘朱雀加于日干</strong>；<strong>驿马在中传</strong>；干支<strong>交车相合</strong>（寅亥合、巳申合）；发用<strong>寅数七</strong>、干上财<strong>亥数四</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先断<q class=\"yw\">会有钱送来</q></strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>财爻</strong>主钱、<strong>朱雀</strong>主音信，两者叠在一起加于<strong>日干</strong>，就是<strong>钱与信一起冲我而来</strong>；<strong>驿马</strong>在传，说明有人要走这一趟。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">时以课中<strong>财爻朱雀加干</strong>，<strong>驿马在中传</strong>，<strong>一、二日内必家中送盘费人来也</strong></q>。后果：<strong>初九日</strong>家中人到，送银一封。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　为什么这么快：反吟＋交车相合</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>返吟</strong>主往复、主速；<strong>干支交车相合</strong>（寅亥合、巳申合）主两边一拍即合、消息交往迅捷。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：所以敢把应期压到<q class=\"yw\"><strong>一二日内</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　⭐ 再断具体数目：类神之数</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：数目取<strong>关键两字之数</strong>：<strong>发用寅为七</strong>，<strong>干上的财亥为四</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">发用<strong>七数</strong>，干上<strong>四数</strong>，必<strong>七两四钱</strong>也</q>——后果分毫不差，张君大笑。&lt;br&gt;⭐ 叶注补了另一种算法：<strong>寅七＋天后亥四＝十一</strong>，也是古人常用的计数路子。<strong>同一盘可有几种数法，取哪一种要靠经验。</strong></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⚠️ 郭御青自己的话最该记</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：断中了之后，他没有自夸，而是说：<q class=\"yw\">余于此课亦<strong>偶中</strong>耳，<strong>定数最壬课之难者</strong>。</q></li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⭐ <strong>断数目是六壬里最难、最不稳的一块</strong>。方向、性质、应期可以断得很硬，<strong>具体数字要留余地</strong>——这是名家的自我节制，比那句<q class=\"yw\">七两四钱</q>更值得学。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">余嫌反吟不美，时以课中<strong>财爻朱雀加干，驿马在中传，一、二日内必家中送盘费人来也</strong>。初九日，果家中人至，送银一封……余曰：<strong>发用七数，干上四数，必七两四钱也</strong>；张君大笑。<strong>余于此课亦偶中耳，定数最壬课之难者。</strong></q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：返吟＋干支交车相合（事速）＋财爻乘朱雀加干·驿马在中传（一二日内有人送钱来）＋发用寅七·干上财亥四（七两四钱）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：一两日内家里会派人送盘缠来；数目七两四钱（后果分毫不差）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 财爻＋朱雀加干＝钱与信同来　② 驿马在传＝有人上路　③ ⭐ 数目取类神之数（寅七·亥四）　④ ⚠️ 定数是壬课最难的一块，要留余地</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例二十二（郭御青占会场盘费，《郭氏占案》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p289｜PDF p1021〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q24": "<h3 id=\"例24-乙丑日-这笔债能要回来-但他得先卖房子-六亲-天将-墓神-递生递克\">【例24】⭐ 乙丑日 · 这笔债能要回来，但他得先卖房子 <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>墓神</code> <code>递生递克</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：重审课 · 乙丑日巳将未时 · 三传亥酉未自长生传鬼传墓，初中空亡，末传未乘白虎冲支</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：乾隆辛巳年七月<strong>乙丑日</strong>未时，占<strong>去要一笔债</strong>——对方还不还得上。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 索债：日干为我·日支为对方 / 支上生干＝有心还 / 阴神看对方的毛病 / 三传自生传鬼传墓＝日就衰败 / ⭐ 末传冲宅＝卖屋还债 / 附苗公索债法</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">父母　天后　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　官鬼　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　妻财　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>支上亥水生日干</strong>；亥的<strong>阴神酉加亥上</strong>——<strong>酉是乙日之鬼、乘玄武</strong>；<strong>未乘白虎</strong>；<strong>三传</strong> <strong>亥（长生）→ 酉（鬼）→ 未（墓）</strong>，初中<strong>空亡</strong>，末传<strong>未冲日支丑（宅）</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 先摆位置：我是干，对方是支</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：索债的定位：<strong>日干为我方，日支为对方</strong>。课自<strong>支上发用</strong>，说明<q class=\"yw\">课传极类其人</q>——整张盘讲的都是欠债人。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<strong>支上亥水生日干</strong> ⇒ <q class=\"yw\"><strong>是有心要还也</strong></q>——先把<q class=\"yw\">赖不赖账</q>这一条定了：<strong>不是有意不还</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　那为什么还不上：看阴神</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：对方的毛病，要翻到<strong>支上神的阴神</strong>去看。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">奈<strong>阴神酉加亥上</strong>，<strong>酉乃乙日之鬼，乘玄武</strong>，<strong>酉加亥为酒</strong>，玄武为嬉戏之神、走减之杀，<strong>未乘白虎为赌博</strong>呼庐而散财也</q>⇒ 断此人<strong>好赌好饮</strong>、家道日衰。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　⭐ 三传就是他的下坡路</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：把三传放到日干的十二长生里读：<strong>自长生 → 鬼 → 墓</strong>，一路往下。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>三传自生传鬼，自鬼传墓，安得不败坏乎</strong></q>⇒ 断<strong>将来居屋都要卖</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　钱从哪来、能收几成</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>支为宅</strong>；末传<strong>冲支</strong>就是<strong>动到房子</strong>。收几成看<strong>财上乘什么将</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>卖屋者，支为宅，末传未乘虎冲之也</strong></q>⇒ <strong>卖了屋才有钱还</strong>；<q class=\"yw\">屋卖而<strong>末传见财，为干之财库，故尚有也</strong>。<strong>不全者，白虎临于其上耳</strong></q>⇒ 能收回，但<strong>不是全数</strong>。问之果然。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　附：苗公的索债定位法</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：另一路口径，一并记住：<q class=\"yw\">占索债，当以<strong>日为财，辰（支）为债主，时为欠债人</strong>。<strong>时吉索得</strong>，若囚死克不得；<strong>时反克日辰者，负债必无还心</strong>。干吉辰伤不能全得，<strong>干支俱吉，终久必得</strong>。</q></li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⭐ 两套定位（干为我／支为他 vs 日财·辰债主·时欠债人）都能用，<strong>同一课两条路对照着走，结论一致才敢下断</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">此债<strong>非其人有心不还</strong>，实因<strong>好赌好饮</strong>，日就衰败，<strong>将来居屋都要卖，卖屋始能得其财，然亦不能全其数矣</strong>，问之果然。盖<strong>支上亥水生干，是有心要还也</strong>……<strong>三传自生传鬼，自鬼传墓，安得不败坏乎</strong>。卖屋者，<strong>支为宅，末传未乘虎冲之也</strong>……不全者，白虎临于其上耳。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：支上亥水生干（有心要还）＋阴神酉乘玄武·酉加亥为酒·未乘白虎为赌（好赌好饮·日衰）＋三传自长生传鬼传墓（家道败坏）＋末传未乘虎冲日支丑宅（卖屋才有钱）＋财在末传而白虎临之（能得但不全）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：对方不是故意赖账，是好赌好酒败了家；将来要卖房子才还得上，且还不满全数</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 索债：日干为我、日支为对方　② 支上生干＝有心还；毛病看它的阴神　③ ⭐ 三传自长生传鬼传墓＝家道日衰　④ 末传冲支＝动到房子　⑤ 附苗公法：日为财·辰为债主·时为欠债人</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例三十（王牧夫占索债，《牧夫占验》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p293｜PDF p1025〕</span></p>\n<hr>"});